  "notes": [
    "Domain-verified / public-source verified 2026-09-27 (official + Mobile + 48pedia + fandom; no ASR).",
    "Opening sketch is monthly-rotating member comedy before overture — do not hardcode one コント title.",
    "MC1／自己紹介 = photo + member intros + catchcopies; user grade map may split photo then intro.",
    "Encore call sits AFTER Fan Letter and BEFORE Fugiri/Hanpa (not after To be continued).",
    "MC4 sits after Hanpa, before To be continued (user mc3).",
    "Skip translating: encore_call, end_greetings (arigatou wall after finale). Still detect so they are not merged into MC/outro.",
    "Optional thin post_song_sketch common between unit songs in block B; grade example ~13s.",
    "Song durations fairly stable; talk lengths vary (LOD may trim). Prefer glossary romaji Saka Agari (reject Sakagari).",
    "Low-confidence: unit understudies, birthday/grad/shin-pozi inserts, 16-member cast rotation.",
    "User mc2 (wiki MC3): two consecutive group-talk halves — each performer group talks among themselves; long combined span (~typical 780s). Finder may emit one span or two sub-spans; grade key often one block."
  ],
